# Node keys at rot scale skew pivot a z on paper, 256x128. Cells 1-6 each draw a red 36x20 rect outlined 2px ink, plus a
# small dark ink dot marking a reference point, so the transform is readable. Four cells per row, left to right, top to
# bottom:
# (1) plain: horizontal rect, centered on the dot at its at: position. (2) rot:30: the rect tilted clockwise 30
# degrees about the dot. (3) scale:1.5,0.7: the rect wider (54 px) and flatter (14 px) than cell 1, still centered on
# the dot. (4) skew:30,0: a parallelogram whose top edge spans x 200..236 and bottom edge x 212..248, so the top is
# shifted LEFT of the bottom. Undocumented, current behavior: the sign of skew; the docs do not say which way a
# positive x skew leans.
# Second row has four cells: (5) rot:45 pivot:-18,0 at:36,80: the rect swings 45 degrees clockwise about the pivot
# point (18,80), where the dot is. Undocumented, current behavior: the pivot point stays at its unrotated spot (18,80),
# the rect's left end, so the left end stays at the dot and the rect extends down and to the right from it. (6) a:.4:
# the same rect at 40 percent opacity, pale pink with a gray outline, both faded. (7) two blue circles side by side,
# the left fully opaque, the right with a:.5, so the right one is a clearly paler, see-through blue than the left.
# (8) order:behind: a red circle declared after a blue circle that overlaps it but order:behind puts it under, so the blue
# circle covers part of the red one and only a red crescent shows on the right.
@artboard 256x128
@target shapes/transforms.png

rect 36x20 at:32,32 fill:p.red stroke:p.ink,2
circle 2 at:32,32 fill:p.ink
rect 36x20 rot:30 at:96,32 fill:p.red stroke:p.ink,2
circle 2 at:96,32 fill:p.ink
rect 36x20 scale:1.5,.7 at:160,32 fill:p.red stroke:p.ink,2
circle 2 at:160,32 fill:p.ink
rect 36x20 skew:30,0 at:224,32 fill:p.red stroke:p.ink,2
circle 2 at:224,32 fill:p.ink
rect 36x20 rot:45 pivot:-18,0 at:36,80 fill:p.red stroke:p.ink,2
circle 2 at:18,80 fill:p.ink
rect 36x20 a:.4 at:96,96 fill:p.red stroke:p.ink,2
circle 14 at:152,96 fill:p.blue
circle 14 at:168,96 fill:p.blue a:.5
circle 14 at:216,96 fill:p.blue
circle 14 at:224,96 order:behind fill:p.red
